    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Qaybintii Dhulka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba markaad dhulka saami dhaxal ahaan ugu qaybsataan, waa inaad Rabbiga qurbaan ka siisaan, kaasoo ah dalka qaybtiisa quduuska ah. Meeshaas dhererkeedu waa inuu ahaadaa shan iyo labaatan kun oo cawsduur, oo ballaadhkeeduna waa inuu ahaadaa toban kun oo cawsduur. Oo meeshaas hareeraheeda ku wareegsan oo dhammu waa inay quduus wada ahaadaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waa in taas meesha quduuska ah looga yeelaa jago dhererkeedu yahay shan boqol, oo ballaadhkeeduna yahay shan boqol, oo afar gees ah, oo waa in konton dhudhun agagaarkeeda laga dhigaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intaasna waa inaad ka qiyaastaa meel dhererkeedu yahay shan iyo labaatan kun, ballaadhkeeduna yahay toban kun, oo waxaa dhexdeeda ku oolli doona meesha quduuska ah taas oo ah meesha ugu wada quduusan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waa dalka qaybtiisa quduuska ah, oo waxaa iska leh wadaaddada ah kuwa meesha quduuska ah ka adeega oo u soo dhowaado inay Rabbiga u adeegaan. Oo waxay ahaan doontaa meel ay guryo ka dhistaan, iyo meel quduus ah oo ay daarta quduuska ahu ku dhex taal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meesha dhererkeedu yahay shan iyo labaatan kun oo ballaadhkeeduna yahay toban kun waa inay hanti ahaan u ahaataa reer Laawi oo daarta ka adeega, taas iyo labaatan qolladood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo hantida magaalada waa inaad doorataan, taasoo ah meel ballaadhkeedu yahay shan kun oo cawsduur, oo dhererkeeduna yahay shan iyo labaatan kun oo cawsduur, oo ay ag taal qaybta quduuska ah, oo taasna waxaa iska lahaan doona reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meesha qurbaanka quduuska ah iyo meesha ay hantida magaaladu ku dhex taal dhinacoodan iyo dhinacoodaasba waxaa iska lahaan doona amiirka, meesha qurbaanka quduuska ah horteeda iyo meesha ay hantida magaaladu ku taal horteeda, dhinaca galbeed xaggiisa galbeed iyo dhinaca bari xaggiisa bariba, oo dhererkoodu waa inuu la mid noqdaa qaybaha middood soohdinteeda galbeed iyo soohdinteeda bari inta ka dhex leh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo taasu waxay amiirka u ahaan doontaa hantida uu reer binu Israa'iil ku dhex leeyahay, oo amiirradayduna waa inayan mar dambe dadkayga dulmin, laakiinse dalka waa inay reer binu Israa'iil u siiyaan siday qabiilooyinkoodu kala yihiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Amiirrada reer binu Israa'iilow, intaasu ha idinku filnaato. Dulmiga iyo dhicidda joojiya, oo garsoorid iyo caddaalad sameeya, oo baaddiinnana dadkayga ka fogeeya, ayaa Sayidka Rabbiga ahu leeyahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waa inaad kafado xaq ah iyo eefaah xaq ah iyo bad xaq ah lahaataan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo eefaahda iyo badku waa inay isku qiyaas ahaadaan, eefaahdu waa inay qaaddaa xomeer toban meelood loo dhigay meeshiis, oo badkuna waa inuu qaadaa xomeer toban meelood loo dhigay meeshiis, oo qiyaastuna waa inay ahaataa sida xomeerka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sheqelkuna waa inuu ahaadaa labaatan geeraah, oo maanehiinnuna waa inuu ahaadaa labaatan sheqel, shan iyo labaatan sheqel iyo shan iyo toban sheqel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Qurbaannada Iyo Maalmaha Quduuska Ah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qurbaanka aad bixinaysaanna waa kan: xomeer kasta oo sarreen ahba waa inaad ka bixisaan eefaah lix meelood loo dhigay meesheed, oo haddana xomeer kasta oo shaciir ahba waa inaad ka bixisaan eefaah lix meelood loo dhigay meesheed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo amarka saliidduna waa kan: kor kastaba waa inaad ka bixisaan bad toban meelood loo dhigay meeshiis. Korkuna waa toban bad, sida xomeer oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo labadii tiro oo ido ahba waa inaad ka bixisaan wan laga soo kaxeeyey daaqa barwaaqaysan oo reer binu Israa'iil, oo waa inaad u bixisaan qurbaan hadhuudh ah, iyo qurbaan la gubo, iyo qurbaanno nabaadiino, si aad iyaga ugu kafaaragguddaan aawadeed, ayaa Sayidka Rabbiga ahu leeyahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadka dalka deggan oo dhammu waa inay qurbaankaas amiirka reer binu Israa'iil siiyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo amiirka qaybtiisu waxay ahaan doontaa inuu qurbaannada la gubo, iyo qurbaannada hadhuudhka, iyo qurbaannada cabniinka bixiyo ayaamaha iidaha iyo wakhtiga ay biluhu dhashaan, iyo maalmaha sabtiyada, iyo iidaha reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan. Isagu waa inuu qurbaanka dembiga, iyo qurbaanka hadhuudhka, iyo qurbaanka la gubo, iyo qurbaannada nabaadiinada, diyaariyaa, si reer binu Israa'iil loogu kafaaraggudo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bishii kowaad maalinteedii kowaad waa inaad dibi yar oo aan iin lahayn soo wadataa, oo waa inaad meesha quduuska ah nadiifisaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wadaadku waa inuu qaar ka soo qaadaa dhiigga qurbaanka dembiga, oo waa inuu mariyaa daarta tiirarkeeda, iyo meesha allabariga saldhiggeeda afartiisa gees, iyo tiirarka iridda barxadda gudaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waa inaad bisha maalinteeda toddobaad saas oo kale u samaysaa mid kasta oo qalad ama aqoonla'aan ku dembaaba. Oo waa inaad sidaas daarta ugu kafaaragguddaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo bisha kowaad maalinteeda afar iyo tobnaad waa inaad iiddii kormaridda iiddaan, taasoo ah iid toddoba maalmood ah, waana in la cunaa kibis aan khamiir lahayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalintaas amiirku waa inuu nafsaddiisa iyo dadka dalka oo dhanba dibi qurbaan dembi ah u diyaariyaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo toddobada maalmood oo iiddana waa inuu Rabbiga u diyaariyaa qurbaan la gubo, kaasoo ah toddoba dibi iyo toddoba wan oo aan iin lahayn oo uu toddobada maalmoodba maalin kasta diyaariya, oo maalin kastana waa inuu orgi qurbaan dembi u bixiyaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waa inuu qurbaan hadhuudh ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Badar",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " oo ah eefaah dibiba iyo eefaah wanba diyaariyaa, oo eefah kastana waa inuu hiin saliid ah la bixiyaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo bisha toddobaad maalinteeda shan iyo tobnaadna waa inuu sidaas oo kale sameeyaa iidda toddobada maalmood ah; waa inuu sameeyaa siduu qurbaanka dembigu yahay, iyo siduu qurbaanka la gubo yahay, iyo siduu qurbaanka hadhuudhku yahay, iyo siday saliiddu tahayba.",
